and multimarket. &#10;</div><div>Roles &amp; Responsibilities: &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Design and develop comprehensive reference designs, including both software &#10;</div><div>and hardware solutions, for emerging interfaces on ADI products. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Perform functional and system-level validation, with a focus on compliance &#10;</div><div>testing for high-speed interfaces such as DDR, USB, SPDIF, and Ethernet. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Customize reference designs to meet customer-specific requirements, ensuring &#10;</div><div>seamless integration with ADI processors. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Collaborate directly with Tier-1 and OEM customers (on-site or off-site) to resolve &#10;</div><div>technical challenges and accelerate their transition to production. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Create technical documentation, articles, proof of concept platforms, and &#10;</div><div>deliver training sessions to customers and internal ADI sales/support teams. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Act as a key liaison between customers and our product development teams, &#10;</div><div>providing valuable feedback for the definition of next-generation products. &#10;</div><div>&#8226; Analyze system-level requirements for targeted markets and applications, &#10;</div><div>working with cross-functional teams to drive product definition and execution. &#10;</div><div>Candidate Qualifications: &#10;</div><div>1. Education: Bachelor&#8217;s or Master&#8217;s degree in Electrical/Electronics Engineering, &#10;</div><div>with strong fundamentals in Digital Signal Processing and &#10;</div><div>microprocessors/microcontrollers. &#10;</div><div>2. Core Skills: &#10;</div><div>1. Strong foundational knowledge of Digital Signal Processing (DSP) and &#10;</div><div>microprocessors/microcontrollers. &#10;</div><div>2. Proficiency in C programming is mandatory. &#10;</div><div>3. Solid understanding of electronics engineering and familiarity with standard &#10;</div><div>communication protocols such as I2C, SPI, and UART. &#10;</div><div>3. Desired Experience: &#10;</div><div>1. Hands-on experience with DSP algorithm implementation and optimization &#10;</div><div>on processors. &#10;</div><div>2. Experience with Python and/or assembly programming &#10;</div><div>3. Familiarity with tools like MATLAB. &#10;</div><div>4. Personal Attributes &#10;</div><div>1. Exceptional interpersonal, teamwork, and communication skills. &#10;</div><div>2. Excellent organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple projects &#10;</div><div>and prioritize effectively. &#10;</div><div>3. Self-motivated, innovative, and a positive team contributor. &#10;</div><div>5. Travel: Willingness to travel domestically or internationally (10%&#8211;15%).</div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Analog Devices","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":9862,"created_by_name":"sowmya Nihar","updated_by":8526,"created_at":1761394071000,"updated_at":1761560227000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":529,"company_name":"Analog Devices","source":"Existing Database","website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":8524,"updated_by":10660,"created_at":1760341820000,"updated_at":1784607821000},"questions":[],"documents":[{"documentName":null,"jd_document_id":752,"application_id":668,"document_id":9035,"user_id":9862,"document_type_id":5,"uuid":"49acb80f-41ff-4030-b599-613c9efab577","file_name":"Analog Design Engineering-FTE","file_original_name":"Analog Design Engineering-FTE.pdf","fil